Z||000009||Mach10||08-21-2001||06:30 PM||||IMHO, you can't get more features for the money. Triple line outs, flap face, HPF on full channels, Separate front/rear Bass/treble controls, Remote, can read CDRWsputsSub/w variable x-over, level adjust, AND on/off control.<BR>The DEHP-430 rocks ass.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
