Z||000022||sqoach||08-21-2001||10:29 PM||||If you're wanting a really nice cd player with lots of features, try the JVC El Kameleon LX-30. 45x4 watts per channel. Front, rear, and sub outs. The sub out has a built in crossover. BBE sound control. Reads CD-RW's and CD-R's. Stealth face. Remote. CD Text.<BR>I've had mine for about 7 months, and I love it still. OnlineCarStereo.com has it on sale right now for $199. And I think shipping is free if the order is over $100. Can't remember for sure.<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||14
