Z||000031||fieronv||08-22-2001||12:29 AM||||Get the replacement driver for your sub from Rodney Dickman 36.00 american. As for the pillar speakers I like Infinity Kappa 462.1cf youcan get these at Crutchfields for 89.95 american. The 4x10's you can go any number of ways, I used to have a set of Kenwoods and was very pleased with them. Look around on the online shops for the 4x10's they should be around 100 american. hope that this helps. You should be pleased with a set up like this without going to extremes (like some of us).  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <BR>Sooner or later I'm putting in a full navigation and DVD theatre in mine.<P>------------------<BR>85GT (twoloud)||||reg||1
